cale\" data-en=\"Measurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 14 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 14 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 14 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"চারটি common data issue, এদের পার্থক্য এবং record delete, replace বা correct করার আগে কীভাবে investigate করতে হয় তা শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Learn four common data issues, why they are not interchangeable, and how to investigate before deleting, replacing, or correcting records.\">Learn four common data issues, why they are not interchangeable, and how to investigate before deleting, replacing, or correcting records.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 50 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Missing, duplicate, invalid ও outlier value আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Differentiate missing, duplicate, invalid, and outlier values.\">Differentiate missing, duplicate, invalid, and outlier values.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Treatment-এর আগে cause investigate করুন।\" data-en=\"Investigate causes before treatment.\">Investigate causes before treatment.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Defensible action বেছে নিন।\" data-en=\"Choose defensible actions.\">Choose defensible actions.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Change ও sensitivity document করুন।\" data-en=\"Document changes and sensitivity.\">Document changes and sensitivity.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Missing value\" data-en=\"Missing values\">Missing values</h2><p data-bn=\"Missing value মানে usable value recorded নেই, কিন্তু cause আলাদা: not collected, not applicable, refused, lost বা system failure। Blank, zero, “N/A” ও “unknown” automatically equivalent নয়। সম্ভব হলে reason code preserve করুন।\" data-en=\"A missing value means no usable value is recorded, but causes differ: not collected, not applicable, refused, lost, or system failure. Blank, zero, “N/A,” and “unknown” are not automatically equivalent. Preserve reason codes when possible.\">A missing value means no usable value is recorded, but causes differ: not collected, not applicable, refused, lost, or system failure. Blank, zero, “N/A,” and “unknown” are not automatically equivalent. Preserve reason codes when possible.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Duplicate\" data-en=\"Duplicates\">Duplicates</h2><p data-bn=\"Exact duplicate row repeated import থেকে হতে পারে, কিন্তু similar row legitimate repeated event হতে পারে। Remove করার আগে business key ও time rule define করুন। Customer দুই identical order করতে পারে; order ID differ হলে duplicate নয়।\" data-en=\"Exact duplicate rows may result from repeated imports, but similar rows can be legitimate repeated events. Define a business key and time rule before removing duplicates. A customer can place two identical orders; they are not duplicates if order IDs differ.\">Exact duplicate rows may result from repeated imports, but similar rows can be legitimate repeated events. Define a business key and time rule before removing duplicates. A customer can place two identical orders; they are not duplicates if order IDs differ.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Invalid value\" data-en=\"Invalid values\">Invalid values</h2><p data-bn=\"Invalid value declared rule violate করে: impossible date, return separate flag হলে negative quantity, বা dictionary-এর বাইরে code। Rule domain reality reflect করবে; unusual হলেই rare value invalid নয়।\" data-en=\"Invalid values violate a declared rule: impossible dates, negative quantity when returns use a separate flag, or category codes outside the dictionary. Rules must reflect domain reality; a rare value is not invalid merely because it is unusual.\">Invalid values violate a declared rule: impossible dates, negative quantity when returns use a separate flag, or category codes outside the dictionary. Rules must reflect domain reality; a rare value is not invalid merely because it is unusual.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-4\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">04</div><h2 data-bn=\"Outlier\" data-en=\"Outliers\">Outliers</h2><p data-bn=\"Outlier অন্য value বা expected pattern থেকে unusually distant। এটি error, rare real event বা সবচেয়ে important observation হতে পারে। Exclusion-এর আগে source, unit, timing ও context investigate করুন। Appropriate হলে influential point-সহ ও ছাড়া result compare করুন।\" data-en=\"An outlier is unusually distant from other values or an expected pattern. It may be an error, a rare but real event, or the most important observation. Investigate source, unit, timing, and context before exclusion. Compare results with and without influential points when appropriate.\">An outlier is unusually distant from other values or an expected pattern. It may be an error, a rare but real event, or the most important observation. Investigate source, unit, timing, and context before exclusion. Compare results with and without influential points when appropriate.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Missingness\" data-en=\"Missingness\">Missingness</h3><p data-bn=\"Value absent হওয়ার pattern ও reason।\" data-en=\"The pattern and reason values are absent.\">The pattern and reason values are absent.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Business key\" data-en=\"Business key\">Business key</h3><p data-bn=\"Context-এ entity বা event uniquely identify করা field।\" data-en=\"Fields that uniquely identify an entity or event in context.\">Fields that uniquely identify an entity or event in context.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Invalid value\" data-en=\"Invalid value\">Invalid value</h3><p data-bn=\"Documented rule violate করা value।\" data-en=\"A value that violates a documented rule.\">A value that violates a documented rule.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Outlier\" data-en=\"Outlier\">Outlier</h3><p data-bn=\"Distribution বা model pattern থেকে unusually distant observation।\" data-en=\"An observation unusually distant from a distribution or model pattern.\">An observation unusually distant from a distribution or model pattern.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Order record responsibly clean\" data-en=\"Cleaning order records responsibly\">Cleaning order records responsibly</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"File-এ blank customer age, repeated order ID, negative quantity ও একটি exceptionally large order আছে।\" data-en=\"The file has blank customer ages, repeated order IDs, a negative quantity, and one exceptionally large order.\">The file has blank customer ages, repeated order IDs, a negative quantity, and one exceptionally large order.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Age required কি না এবং missing reason determine করুন।\" data-en=\"Determine whether age is required and why it is missing.\">Determine whether age is required and why it is missing.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"order_id plus line_id দিয়ে true duplicate confirm করুন।\" data-en=\"Use order_id plus line_id to confirm true duplicates.\">Use order_id plus line_id to confirm true duplicates.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Negative quantity return represent করে কি না check করুন।\" data-en=\"Check whether negative quantity represents a return.\">Check whether negative quantity represents a return.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Large order source document দিয়ে verify করুন।\" data-en=\"Verify the large order against source documents.\">Verify the large order against source documents.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"প্রতিটি treatment record এবং change-এর আগে/পরে key result compare করুন।\" data-en=\"Record every treatment and compare key results before and after changes.\">Record every treatment and compare key results before and after changes.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Cleaning হলো evidence-based correction ও documentation; inconvenient record automatic delete নয়।\" data-en=\"Cleaning is evidence-based correction and documentation—not automatic deletion of inconvenient records.\">Cleaning is evidence-based correction and documentation—not automatic deletion of inconvenient records.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Different issue-এর different treatment প্রয়োজন।\" data-en=\"Different issues require different treatments.\">Different issues require different treatments.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Data change-এর আগে cause investigate করুন।\" data-en=\"Investigate causes before changing data.\">Investigate causes before changing data.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Outlier error বা valuable real event হতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Outliers may be errors or valuable real events.\">Outliers may be errors or valuable real events.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"প্রতিটি transformation document করুন।\" data-en=\"Document every transformation.\">Document every transformation.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/ppc/section4/ppc41.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST/SEMATECH — First Steps in Data Analysis ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unstats.un.org/UNSDWebsite/data-quality\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">United Nations Statistics Division — Data Quality ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}